ent":"Enroll the device"},"1606":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#verify-the-obtained-identity","content":"Verify the obtained identity"},"1607":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#demonstrate-an-mtls-connection","content":"Demonstrate an mTLS connection"},"1608":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#result-and-continuity","content":"Result and continuity"},"1609":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","content":"Prepare an evaluation DMS, enroll `est-device-001` from the client and use its identity with a local consumer that requires a certificate. The path connects administrator policy to the material the device actually installs."},"1610":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#before-you-begin","content":"A Lamassu instance accessible through HTTPS and permissions for CAs, profiles, DMSs and reading devices/certificates."},"1611":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#before-you-begin","content":"Bash, OpenSSL 3.x, curl with `--fail-with-body` and two terminals on your computer. Work in a new directory with restricted access."},"1612":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#before-you-begin","content":"An active root CA that issues directly, with an available key and sufficient validity. Follow Create your first CA. Save its verified public certificate as `device-root.pem`."},"1613":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#before-you-begin","content":"Available global identifier `est-device-001`. This path uses automatic registration: do not create the device in the console first."},"1614":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#before-you-begin","content":"The approved root for Lamassu HTTPS in `est-trust.pem`, obtained through an independent channel. It can differ from the device CA; prepare networking/TLS in Deployment."},"1615":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#prepare-the-bootstrap-credential","content":"Issue a bootstrap leaf certificate with `CN=est-device-001`, its own key and Client Authentication use. Follow Issue and verify a certificate, changing its CN and saving the result as `bootstrap.crt` and `bootstrap.key`. Choose validity that covers this test and check the pair and chain."},"1616":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#prepare-the-bootstrap-credential","content":"The same root CA can issue it for this isolated evaluation. The operational identity will have a different key and certificate. The matching CN makes the example easier to read; initial certificate authentication does not itself bind the bootstrap CN to the requested ID. Review admission before applying the policy to a population."},"1617":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#configure-the-evaluation-dms","content":"Create an explicit leaf profile compatible with EC P-256, with **Honor Subject**, CN from the CSR, **Digital Signature**, **Client Authentication** and **1 hour** validity within the root's validity. Do not enable CA signing. Rules and precedence are explained in Profiles."},"1618":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#configure-the-evaluation-dms","content":"Create the `Acme EST Evaluation` DMS with this configuration:"},"1619":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#configure-the-evaluation-dms","content":"Setting"},"1620":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#configure-the-evaluation-dms","content":"Evaluation value"},"1621":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#configure-the-evaluation-dms","content":"Enrollment CA"},"1622":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#configure-the-evaluation-dms","content":"Issuing root from `device-root.pem`."},"1623":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#configure-the-evaluation-dms","content":"Issuance profile"},"1624":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#configure-the-evaluation-dms","content":"The 1-hour leaf profile you just prepared."},"1625":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#configure-the-evaluation-dms","content":"Protocol / Registration Mode"},"1626":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#configure-the-evaluation-dms","content":"`EST_RFC7030` / `JITP`."},"1627":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#configure-the-evaluation-dms","content":"Verify CSR Signature"},"1628":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#configure-the-evaluation-dms","content":"Enabled."},"1629":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#configure-the-evaluation-dms","content":"Enable Replaceable Enrollment"},"1630":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#configure-the-evaluation-dms","content":"Disabled; the ID must be new."},"1631":{"id