king the successor, retire the previous certificate according to PKI policy; the example does not revoke it automatically."},"1671":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-71","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#result-and-continuity","content":"Devices and identities explains retirement and the limits of historical revocation. For a real destination, prepare consumer trust, validation and permissions; AWS IoT Core is an available integration."},"1672":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","type":"page","content":"Register a device manually","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Platform","IoT Fleets","Getting started"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device"},"1673":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","content":"Prepare a DMS, register a device and associate a verified certificate with its identity."},"1674":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#before-you-begin","content":"Before you begin"},"1675":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepare-the-dms"