":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#register-the-device","content":"**Icon** and **Tags**: optional classification."},"1701":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#register-the-device","content":"Confirm registration."},"1702":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#check-the-initial-status","content":"Open the device. It should appear in **No Identity** and show the selected owning DMS."},"1703":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#check-the-initial-status","content":"Registration creates the inventory entry; the certificate must still be associated."},"1704":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#assign-an-identity","content":"Select **Assign Identity** and the existing certificate with `CN=device-001`. Check its serial number, issuer and validity against the certificate you verified in PKI."},"1705":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#assign-an-identity","content":"Confirm the association. The **Issue New Instead** alternative is explained in Devices and identities."},"1706":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#verify-the-device","content":"Check that it has an active identity. In **Certificate History**, verify the associated serial number; in **Device Event Timeline**, find the assignment event."},"1707":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#verify-the-device","content":"Keep the device identifier, owning DMS and serial number as references for the result."},"1708":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#expected-result","content":"Check"},"1709":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-36","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#expected-result","content":"Result"},"1710":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-37","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#expected-result","content":"Device"},"1711":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/plat