iration or renewal state appears, check certificate dates and DMS thresholds in Devices and identities."},"1722":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-49","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#automate-the-next-device","content":"Continue with DMS and EST for the device to request and renew certificates. Prepare server trust, the initial credential and policies for each operation before implementing the client."},"1723":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-50","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#automate-the-next-device","content":"For a path from the client through mTLS, follow Enroll and connect your first device with a new ID."},"1724":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-51","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#automate-the-next-device","content":"To use the identity in AWS IoT Core, also prepare trust and permissions in the destination. Check the connection from the device after installing the required key, certificate and chain."},"1725":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/overview","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/overview","type":"page","content":"Lamassu IoT Platform","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Platform"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/overview"},"1726":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/overview-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/overview","content":"Build a PKI and apply its certificates