ent's private key;"},"2448":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/pki/overview-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/pki/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/pki/overview#how-to-check-the-result","content":"its chain reaches a root trusted by the consumer;"},"2449":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/pki/overview-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/pki/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/pki/overview#how-to-check-the-result","content":"its dates and usages allow the operation;"},"2450":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/pki/overview-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/pki/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/pki/overview#how-to-check-the-result","content":"the consumer applies revocation checks and authorization."},"2451":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/pki/overview-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/pki/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/pki/overview#how-to-check-the-result","content":"The issuance path includes the first independent checks."},"2452":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/pki/overview-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/pki/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/pki/overview#continue","content":"<Card title=\"PKI getting started\" description=\"Create a CA, then issue and verify a client certificate.\" href=\"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview\" />"},"2453":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/pki/overview-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/pki/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/pki/overview#continue","content":"<Card title=\"Apply PKI to devices\" description=\"Associate certificates with inventory and prepare enrollment.\" href=\"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/overview\" />"},"2454":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/pki/overview-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/pki/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/pki/overview#continue","content":"<Card title=\"PKI diagnostics\" description=\"Check issuance, OCSP and CRL when the result fails.\" href=\"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting\" />"},"2455":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","type":"page","content":"Create your first CA","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Platform","PKI","Getting started"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority"},"2456":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","content":"Create an evaluation root and check its certificate before issuing."},"2457":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#before-you-begin","content":"Before you begin"},"2458":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#open-the-creation-wizard-toc","content":"Open the creation wizard [!toc]"},"2459":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/pla