":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/security#responsible-disclosure","content":"Maintainers acknowledge reports in a timely manner and keep you informed of remediation progress."},"2635":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/security-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/security#responsible-disclosure","content":"This policy covers the source code, configuration, and CI/CD workflows of the lamassuiot, lamassu-dashboard, and lamassu-helm repositories."},"2636":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0","type":"page","content":"3.8.0 to 4.0.0","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Upgrades"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0"},"2637":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0","content":"What changes in the 4.0.0 architecture, which changes break a 3.8.0 deployment, how to upgrade a Helm release step by step and how to validate the result."},"2638":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0#architecture-changes","content":"Architecture changes"},"2639":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0#one-postgresql-database-with-schemas","content":"One PostgreSQL database with schemas"},"2640":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0#authorization-moves-into-the-authz-service",