llamadas AWS que ejecuta cada flujo. La máquina de estados de cada recurso está junto a su explicación detallada; la última columna enlaza a ella. Los recursos de AWS se referencian con la notación `IoTCore/<recurso>`."},"1388":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-113","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#eventos-y-recursos-de-aws","content":"La columna **Tipo de CloudEvent** lista el nombre del evento en el bus interno de Lamassu; la columna **Acciones IAM** lista las operaciones exactas del SDK de AWS que invoca cada flujo, para que los permisos necesarios se deriven directamente de esta tabla."},"1389":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-114","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#eventos-y-recursos-de-aws","content":"Tipo de CloudEvent"},"1390":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-115","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#eventos-y-recursos-de-aws","content":"Recurso en Lamassu"},"1391":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-116","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#eventos-y-recursos-de-aws","content":"Recurso AWS"},"1392":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-117","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text"