-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"Si el resultado falla"},"1681":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#automatiza-el-siguiente-dispositivo","content":"Automatiza el siguiente dispositivo"},"1682":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","content":"Este recorrido está dirigido a quien empieza a administrar identidades de dispositivos. Registrarás `device-001` y le asignarás un certificado existente para comprobar la relación entre dispositivo, DMS e historial de identidad."},"1683":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","content":"La asignación modifica el inventario de Lamassu. La clave y el certificado se instalan por separado en el dispositivo; la conexión con un consumidor se comprueba en la integración de ese destino."},"1684":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#antes-de-empezar","content":"Una instancia accesible y permisos para administrar DMS, dispositivos y la asociación de certificados."},"1685":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#antes-de-empezar","content":"Una CA activa con clave disponible. Si todavía no existe, sigue Crea tu primera CA."},"1686":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#antes-de-empezar","content":"Un certificado final activo de esa CA cuyo `Common Name` sea exactamente `device-001`, con su clave privada. Sigue Emite y verifica un certificado para obtener y comprobar ambos."},"1687":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#antes-de-empezar","content":"El identificador `device-001` libre en el inventario. Si ya lo usaste, elige otro y emite el certificado con ese mismo `Common Name`."},"1688":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepara-el-dms","content":"Un DMS debe existir antes de registrar el dispositivo. Si ya tienes uno adecuado, comprueba su CA y anota su identificador; si necesitas crearlo:"},"1689":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepara-el-dms","content":"Abre el inventario de DMS y la acción de creación. Asigna un nombre reconocible, como `Acme Evaluation DMS`."},"1690":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepara-el-dms","content":"En **Enrollment CA**, selecciona la CA que emitió `device.crt`."},"1691":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepara-el-dms","content":"En **Registration Mode**, selecciona `PRE_REGISTRATION` para el recorrido que comienza con un alta explícita."},"1692":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepara-el-dms","content":"En la sección de autenticación, activa **Require client certificate** y deja **Call external webhook** desactivado. Bajo **Require client certificate**, añade a **Validation CAs** la CA cuyos certificados iniciales aceptarás; para esta evaluación puede ser la misma CA. Mantén habilitada **Verify CSR Signature** y deja **Enable server-side key generation** desactivado si no lo vas a utilizar."},"1693":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepara-el-dms","content":"Revisa los ajustes de renovación y distribución de confianza con la guía DMS, guarda el servicio y anota su identificador."},"1694":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepara-el-dms","content":"Vuelve a abrir el DMS y confirma que la CA de enrolamiento es la prevista y que el servicio aparece en el inventario."},"1695":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepara-el-dms","content":"Estos ajustes preparan la política DMS. Los pasos siguientes realizan el alta y la asignación desde la consola; no envían una solicitud EST ni prueban la admisión por ese protocolo."},"1696":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#registra-el-dispositivo","content":"Abre **Managed Devices** y la acción de registro. Completa:"},"1697":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#registra-el-dispositivo","content":"**Device ID**: `device-001`."},"1698":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-68/es/platform/iot-fleet